// A mixin script. Each mixin { } below becomes a real mixin into a Minecraft class, applied before the
// game loads its first class, so a new or changed declaration takes effect after a restart. The bodies in
// { } can be swapped while the game runs: /hollowengine scripting run {{path}}
//
// Everything a declaration says is read by the compiler, so its arguments must be constants. A script
// that changes client-only classes needs @file:ClientSide at the top.

import net.minecraft.world.entity.player.Player

mixin<Player> {
    method("jumpFromGround") {
        after {
            // Runs after every jump. `self` is the player, `args` the arguments of the method.
        }
    }
}
